---
// HTTP Protocol Evolution Diagram (HTTP/1.1 -> HTTP/2 -> HTTP/3 QUIC)
---

<figure class="http-evo-diagram" aria-labelledby="http-evo-caption">
  <svg
    class="http-evo-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="http-evo-title http-evo-desc"
  >
    <title id="http-evo-title">
      傳輸協定演進全景：HTTP/1.1 ➔ HTTP/2 ➔ HTTP/3 (QUIC)
    </title>
    <desc id="http-evo-desc">
      展示 HTTP/1.1 隊頭阻塞（Head-of-Line Blocking）、HTTP/2 單一 TCP
      多路復用（Multiplexing）但仍受限 TCP 層阻塞，到 HTTP/3 基於 UDP/QUIC
      實現獨立 Stream 零阻塞與 0-RTT 連線建立的底層技術演進。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="hevo-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="http-evo-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="hevo-arrow-accent"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="http-evo-diagram__arrow-head--accent"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Stage 1: HTTP/1.1 (Left Column) -->
    <g class="http-evo-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26">GEN 1 (1997)</text>
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__title" x="18" y="54"
        >HTTP/1.1 (TCP 序列化)</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="80"
        >• 純文字 ASCII 協定</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="102"
        >• 一個 TCP 連線同時間只能處理一筆請求</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="124"
        >• 隊頭阻塞 (HoL Blocking)：慢請求卡死後續</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="146"
        >• 瀏覽器破局解法：開 6 個並行 TCP 連線</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="168"
        >• 大量重複冗餘的 HTTP Headers</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 200)">
        <rect width="234" height="140" rx="8" class="http-evo-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="http-evo-diagram__subtitle" x="12" y="24"
          >⚠️ 瓶頸與代價</text
        >
        <text class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="50"
          >• TCP 握手 + TLS 握手 (3-RTT 延遲)</text
        >
        <text class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="72"
          >• 連線耗盡伺服器檔案描述符 (FD)</text
        >
        <text class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="94"
          >• Sprite 雪碧圖 / 資源內聯等妥協 Hack</text
        >
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__tag http-evo-diagram__tag--warn"
          x="12"
          y="122">應用層隊頭阻塞嚴重</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 1 to 2 -->
    <path
      class="http-evo-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 300 220 H 335"
      marker-end="url(#hevo-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 2: HTTP/2 (Center Column) -->
    <g
      class="http-evo-diagram__card http-evo-diagram__card--blue"
      transform="translate(345, 40)"
    >
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="http-evo-diagram__badge http-evo-diagram__badge--blue"
        x="18"
        y="26">GEN 2 (2015)</text
      >
      <text
        class="http-evo-diagram__title http-evo-diagram__title--blue"
        x="18"
        y="54">HTTP/2 (二進位多路復用)</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="80"
        >• 二進位分幀 (Binary Framing Layer)</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="102"
        >• 單一 TCP 多路復用 (Multiplexing)</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="124"
        >• HPACK 標頭壓縮 (節省 80% Header)</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="146"
        >• 串流優先級 (Stream Prioritization)</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="168"
        >• 伺服器主動推播 (Server Push)</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 200)">
        <rect width="234" height="140" rx="8" class="http-evo-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__subtitle http-evo-diagram__subtitle--blue"
          x="12"
          y="24">⚠️ 隱藏的 TCP 物理瓶頸</text
        >
        <text class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="50"
          >• TCP 保證全域字節順序 (Byte-Stream)</text
        >
        <text class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="72"
          >• 單個封包丟失 (Packet Loss) 導致</text
        >
        <text class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="94">
          該 TCP 上所有 Stream 全部暫停卡死</text
        >
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__tag http-evo-diagram__tag--warn"
          x="12"
          y="122">傳輸層 TCP 隊頭阻塞</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 2 to 3 -->
    <path
      class="http-evo-diagram__arrow http-evo-diagram__arrow--accent"
      d="M 615 220 H 650"
      marker-end="url(#hevo-arrow-accent)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 3: HTTP/3 QUIC (Right Column) -->
    <g
      class="http-evo-diagram__card http-evo-diagram__card--quic"
      transform="translate(660, 40)"
    >
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="http-evo-diagram__badge http-evo-diagram__badge--quic"
        x="18"
        y="26">GEN 3 (2022+ RFC 9114)</text
      >
      <text
        class="http-evo-diagram__title http-evo-diagram__title--quic"
        x="18"
        y="54">HTTP/3 (QUIC over UDP)</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="80"
        >• 放棄 TCP，直接構建於 UDP 之上</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="102"
        >• 真·獨立 Stream：單串流丟包不影響他人</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="124"
        >• 徹底根除任何層級的隊頭阻塞</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="146"
        >• 內建 TLS 1.3：1-RTT 初次 / 0-RTT 重連</text
      >
      <text class="http-evo-diagram__desc" x="18" y="168"
        >• 連線遷移 (Connection Migration)</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 200)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="140"
          rx="8"
          class="http-evo-diagram__subcard http-evo-diagram__subcard--quic"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__subtitle http-evo-diagram__subtitle--quic"
          x="12"
          y="24">🚀 現代架構優勢</text
        >
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc http-evo-diagram__subdesc--quic"
          x="12"
          y="50">• WiFi 切 5G 依 Connection ID 無縫續傳</text
        >
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc http-evo-diagram__subdesc--quic"
          x="12"
          y="72">• QPACK 動態表單壓縮</text
        >
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__subdesc http-evo-diagram__subdesc--quic"
          x="12"
          y="94">• 弱網環境 P99 延遲降低 50%+</text
        >
        <text
          class="http-evo-diagram__tag http-evo-diagram__tag--quic"
          x="12"
          y="122">極致無損低延遲傳輸</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Version -->
  <div class="http-evo-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="http-evo-mobile-card">
      <span class="http-evo-mobile-badge">第 1 代 (1997)</span>
      <h4>HTTP/1.1 (TCP 序列化傳輸)</h4>
      <p>
        純文字協議，單 TCP 連線一次僅能處理單一請求，產生嚴重的應用層隊頭阻塞
        (HoL Blocking)，需開多條 TCP 妥協。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="http-evo-mobile-arrow">↓ 升級為二進位多路復用</div>

    <div class="http-evo-mobile-card http-evo-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="http-evo-mobile-badge http-evo-mobile-badge--blue"
        >第 2 代 (2015)</span
      >
      <h4>HTTP/2 (二進位分幀與單連線復用)</h4>
      <p>
        引入 Binary Framing 與 HPACK 壓縮，單一 TCP 連線並行多
        Stream；但遇到網路丟包時，仍會引發底層 TCP 傳輸層隊頭阻塞。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="http-evo-mobile-arrow">↓ 轉移至 UDP/QUIC 重構核心</div>

    <div class="http-evo-mobile-card http-evo-mobile-card--quic">
      <span class="http-evo-mobile-badge http-evo-mobile-badge--quic"
        >第 3 代 (2022+ RFC 9114)</span
      >
      <h4>HTTP/3 (QUIC over UDP)</h4>
      <p>
        基於 UDP 打造獨立 Stream，單串流丟包不干擾其他串流；內建 TLS 1.3 實現
        0-RTT 極速連線與 Connection ID 網路無縫切換。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="http-evo-caption">
    圖 1：HTTP 協定三代演進：從 HTTP/1.1 應用層阻塞、HTTP/2 二進位多路復用，到
    HTTP/3 QUIC 徹底消除隊頭阻塞。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
